WEBVTT

00:06:28.759 --> 00:06:31.095
So my friend Karen,
who works for American,

00:06:31.137 --> 00:06:34.014
came on the plane
to give the pilot his paperwork.

00:06:34.014 --> 00:06:35.641
She left and waved goodbye.

00:06:36.100 --> 00:06:38.269
When I got to Charlotte, she called me.

00:06:38.310 --> 00:06:41.063
She said, "Paula, what happened?

00:06:41.689 --> 00:06:44.191
You were as white as a sheet."

00:06:44.900 --> 00:06:46.902
I told her and she said, "Yeah.

00:06:47.987 --> 00:06:50.030
Welcome to the world of women."

00:06:50.030 --> 00:06:51.949
(Laughter)

00:06:51.991 --> 00:06:53.826
Now the truth is,

00:06:53.868 --> 00:06:57.621
I will not live long enough
to lose my male privilege.

00:06:58.205 --> 00:07:01.000
I brought it with me when I transitioned.